window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-098-d962c9731420d541.json"]={sha256:"d962c9731420d541b09f6789bfa7fab11f1201686e10373419cf53ceb092c8d6",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-f53ed62dd159700c","url":"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/61/r3/final","title":"NIST SP 800-61 Revision 3","titleEn":"NIST SP 800-61 Revision 3","publisher":"NIST","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-098","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-098","related":[{"id":"security-v27-099","referenceUrls":["https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/84/final"],"title":"NIST SP 800-84：訓練、測試與演練的證據型別矩陣","titleEn":"NIST SP 800-84: evidence types for training, tests and exercises","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付evidence-age.csv、freshness-policy.json、reassessment-log.json與decision-limitations.md，包含每份新舊觀測的關聯。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver evidence-age.csv, freshness-policy.json, reassessment-log.json and decision-limitations.md, linking old and new observations. State which inputs are required, so a percentage cannot silently replace the decision policy.","difference":"將需求拆成知識、工具功能與協作決策三種，指定每種可接受證據；建立需求到證據的多對多映射與不適用標記。","differenceEn":"Classify requirements as knowledge, tool function or coordinated decision-making and specify acceptable evidence for each. Build a many-to-many requirement-to-evidence map with explicit not-applicable states.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["NIST SP 800-61r3把事件回應納入風險管理；本課有效期是合成組織政策，並非NIST要求的分鐘數，也不把新鮮等同真實。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 決策時間60分鐘，五份依據的觀測時間為55、40、30、50、未知；各自有效期10、15、30、5、10分鐘，邊界age≤TTL算新鮮。 年齡5、20、30、10、未知，第一與第三新鮮、第二與第四過期、第五未知；新鮮比例2/5=40%。","NIST SP 800-84區分測試、訓練與演練並討論計畫；本課的12項矩陣是原創課程驗收，不是NIST合規認證分數。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 12項需求分知識4、工具4、協作4；已有知識證據4、工具測試2、協作演練1，另3張簽到表未滿足任何缺項。 有適切證據7/12=58.333333%；若把簽到三張當成缺項完成會誤報10/12=83.333333%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["NIST SP 800-61r3 integrates incident response with risk management. Evidence lifetimes here are synthetic organizational policy, not NIST-prescribed minute values, and freshness alone does not establish truth. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Decision time is minute sixty. Five inputs were observed at 55,40,30,50 and unknown, with respective lifetimes 10,15,30,5,10 minutes. Define freshness inclusively as age no greater than lifetime. Ages are five, twenty, thirty, ten and unknown. The first and third are fresh, second and fourth stale, fifth unknown, giving a fresh-input fraction of 2/5=40%.","NIST SP 800-84 distinguishes tests, training and exercises within a program. The twelve-item matrix here is original course acceptance criteria, not a NIST compliance certification score. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Twelve requirements comprise four knowledge, four tool-function and four coordination items. Available evidence satisfies four knowledge, two tool and one coordination requirement; three attendance sheets satisfy none of the missing items. Appropriate evidence covers 7/12=58.333333%. Treating three attendance sheets as completed missing requirements would falsely report 10/12=83.333333%.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-008","referenceUrls":["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8705.html"],"title":"OAuth mTLS：存取 token 與用戶端憑證綁定","titleEn":"OAuth mTLS: binding access tokens to client certificates","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付evidence-age.csv、freshness-policy.json、reassessment-log.json與decision-limitations.md，包含每份新舊觀測的關聯。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver evidence-age.csv, freshness-policy.json, reassessment-log.json and decision-limitations.md, linking old and new observations. State which inputs are required, so a percentage cannot silently replace the decision policy.","difference":"列token簽章、issuer、audience、到期時間、cnf憑證指紋與TLS端呈現指紋六欄；先完成基本token驗證，再比較兩個指紋。","differenceEn":"Record token signature result, issuer, audience, expiry, cnf certificate thumbprint and the certificate observed on TLS. Complete ordinary token validation before comparing the two thumbprints.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["NIST SP 800-61r3把事件回應納入風險管理；本課有效期是合成組織政策，並非NIST要求的分鐘數，也不把新鮮等同真實。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 決策時間60分鐘，五份依據的觀測時間為55、40、30、50、未知；各自有效期10、15、30、5、10分鐘，邊界age≤TTL算新鮮。 年齡5、20、30、10、未知，第一與第三新鮮、第二與第四過期、第五未知；新鮮比例2/5=40%。","憑證綁定不能取代TLS身分驗證或token受眾驗證；代理終止TLS時，後端看到的憑證資訊必須有可信傳遞契約，不能信任任意header。 20筆已通過基本token驗證的請求中，16筆指紋一致；換證後有3筆仍攜舊token，維持相同20筆母體。 原始符合率16/20×100=80%；未同步換發token後13/20×100=65%。綁定不符的請求必須拒絕而非延用舊指紋。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["NIST SP 800-61r3 integrates incident response with risk management. Evidence lifetimes here are synthetic organizational policy, not NIST-prescribed minute values, and freshness alone does not establish truth. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Decision time is minute sixty. Five inputs were observed at 55,40,30,50 and unknown, with respective lifetimes 10,15,30,5,10 minutes. Define freshness inclusively as age no greater than lifetime. Ages are five, twenty, thirty, ten and unknown. The first and third are fresh, second and fourth stale, fifth unknown, giving a fresh-input fraction of 2/5=40%.","Certificate binding does not replace TLS authentication or token-audience validation. When a proxy terminates TLS, certificate evidence delivered to the backend needs a trusted propagation contract rather than an arbitrary client-controlled header. Of 20 requests passing basic token checks, 16 have matching thumbprints. After a certificate rotation, three of those retain old bound tokens; keep the same 20-request population. Matching rate is 16/20×100=80%; unsynchronized token renewal reduces it to 13/20×100=65%. A binding mismatch is rejected rather than accepted through an old-thumbprint fallback.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-c666997afcd05e3f","url":"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/84/final","title":"NIST SP 800-84 test training and exercise programs","titleEn":"NIST SP 800-84 test training and exercise programs","publisher":"NIST","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-1a562210fe98eb6d","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8705.html","title":"RFC 8705: OAuth mutual TLS and certificate-bound tokens","titleEn":"RFC 8705: OAuth mutual TLS and certificate-bound tokens","publisher":"IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
